From 70b7465d84d1963926030dca7ea5a828f214723f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gezim <gezimos@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 17:18:06 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 097/101] Kompakt: quick settings borders are 2 px

Notification outlines are 2 px; the quick settings tiles, the brightness
slider and the footer buttons were 2 dp, which is 2.66 px at 213 dpi and
drew as two black pixels and a grey one (measured on 328). They are 2 px
now, converted through the current density, so the edge is crisp and the
same weight as the notifications at any display width.

Change-Id: Idbb071cde16b10f7bf2ad1c6d60d20602b97bd8e
---
 .../systemui/qs/footer/ui/compose/FooterActions.kt       | 8 ++++----
 .../systemui/brightness/ui/compose/BrightnessSlider.kt   | 9 +++++----
 .../systemui/qs/panels/ui/compose/infinitegrid/Tile.kt   | 7 ++++---
 3 files changed, 13 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

